 "_meta": {
  "bed": "local ERPNext dev bed, v15.94.3 (frappe 15.96.0), Standard chart of accounts, IDR",
  "recorded": "2026-11-16",
  "ticket": "#1599",
  "about": "ECX3-T0: PUT on Company default accounts and cost centre",
  "names": "synthetic: company \"ECX Probe Co\" (abbr EPC), parties and employees named \"ECX Probe ...\" / \"Probe ...\", bed users replaced by role labels",
  "apiUsers": {
   "apiUserWithSystemManager": "token-auth API user holding the 901-bot role set (Accounts Manager/User, Purchase Manager/User, Stock Manager/User, Sales Manager/User, Projects Manager/User, System Manager) plus HR Manager/User and, from the Supplier probe on, Purchase Master Manager",
   "apiUserWithoutSystemManager": "same roles minus System Manager (and without Purchase Master Manager)"
  },
  "notes": [
   "Request is PUT /api/resource/Company/<name> with a partial body; the response is {data:{...whole Company doc}} (trimmed here to the five default fields and modified).",
   "The bed accepts a PUT from a user WITHOUT System Manager (Accounts Manager is enough).",
   "Refused: a group account (417 ValidationError \"... is a group account.\"), an account of another company (417 ValidationError \"Account X does not belong to company: Y\"), an unknown account/cost centre (417 LinkValidationError \"Could not find ...\"), a stale modified (417 TimestampMismatchError). The income-group case labelled expense<-Income is refused because Direct Income is a GROUP, not because of its type; see expense<-Income leaf.",
   "NOT refused (the plan assumed account types are enforced): payable<-Receivable, payable<-Cash, bank<-Cash, bank<-Receivable, cash<-Bank, expense<-Receivable, expense<-Income leaf, payable<-Income leaf. Company save checks only that the account exists, is a leaf and belongs to the company. Type matching must be done by PMO before the PUT.",
   "NOT refused: cost_center that is a GROUP, and cost_center of another company (200, stored as given).",
   "An unknown body field is dropped silently (200). Setting null or \"\" clears a default (200).",
   "Labels in the case list: the field default_expense_account is reported by the ERP as \"Default Cost of Goods Sold Account\" in the link error."
  ],
  "v16": "differs: text of one error only (stale modified); behaviour identical"
 },
